<code>assert \old(this.size()) + 1 == this.size();</code>
--------------------
<code>assert \result == \old(this.size()) + 1;</code>

However, since the method `addElement` does not return a value (`void`), we cannot use `\result`. Instead, we should directly compare the current size with the old size plus one:

<code>assert this.size() == \old(this.size()) + 1;</code>
--------------------
<code>assert \old(this.size()) + 1 == this.size();</code>
--------------------
<code>assert \old(this.size()) + 1 == this.size();</code>
--------------------
<code>assert \result == \old(this.size()) + 1;</code>
--------------------
